      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-10-009\" hidden></div>\n<h3 class=\"mm-heading mm-h3 mm-header-banner\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20401]\" style=\"background-color: #9CC2E5; color: #FFFFFF; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8pt; margin-bottom: 4pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>1.8. </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: #FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>CARE OF THE WOMEN AFTER BIRTH</span></h3>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20402]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Observations include:</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20403]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Temp</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20404]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pulse</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20405]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>B.P</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20406]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>RR</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20407]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 32.15pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Uterine contractions and loc</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>h</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ia</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20408]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Examine placenta and membranes for </span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20409]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 14.15pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>condition structure, cord vessels and completeness.</span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20410]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Early assessment of emotional state and psychological impact of birth</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20411]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Voiding of bladder, after 6 hours if voiding has not happened and b</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ladder is palpable \u2013 catheteriz</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>e and transfer to obs</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>tetric</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> unit.</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"78a8d1e7f9bf9dd1f89719a6\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-10-009\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 78a8d1e7f9bf9dd1f89719a6\" viewbox=\"1057275 9525 247650 447675\" width=\"26\" height=\"47\" data-mm-natural-width=\"26\" data-mm-natural-height=\"47\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"9dc32ee9b4343976244b567f3826fd240c0a88ec8b44f4f7937a82ab8ae25e08\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"1b7faa6625ff7c0e8d24\" transform=\"translate(1083538 22798)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 295991 L 44927 295991 L 44927 0 L 134781 0 L 134781 295991 L 179708 295991 L 89854 385845 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" fill-opacity=\"1\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20413]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20414]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Any concern in above observations</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"4a90f5bd69cf0b56eec7d3dc\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-10-009\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure 4a90f5bd69cf0b56eec7d3dc\" viewbox=\"1047750 9525 257175 447675\" width=\"27\" height=\"47\" data-mm-natural-width=\"27\" data-mm-natural-height=\"47\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"c4a786b3b2db315477263095393df40b93aa9a43e5c92c48ce727e7c67766abb\"><g data-mm-object-id=\"a7d304c486940103d257\" transform=\"translate(1080976 23495)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0)\"><path d=\"M 0 295592.5 L 44926.25 295592.5 L 44926.25 0 L 134778.75 0 L 134778.75 295592.5 L 179705 295592.5 L 89852.5 385445 Z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" fill-opacity=\"1\" stroke=\"#4472C4\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20416]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 36pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20417]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Transfer to obs</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>tetric</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> unit by following full protocols of transfer.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20418]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; padding-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2022</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>If women have regional analgesia or anesthesia, perform straight leg sign. If she can\u2019t raise straight leg after 4 hours of last dose, then take urgent review from anesthetist.</span></span></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20419]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[20420]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\">\u00a0</p>",
